listitem.para:
Sized constructor: creates an List container with a given number of default-initialized elements. 

count



Number of elements. Listo(10);

Vector constructor: creates an List container from an existing vector of values. 

vec



Vector of values to copy. std::vector<ListP>v=...;
Listo(v);

Initializer list constructor: creates a List container from an initializer list of shared pointers. 

init



Initializer list of shared_ptr<T> to copy. Listo{ptr1,ptr2,ptr3};
